  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "When accessing \".DS_Store\" files on a federated filesystem, the following exception is thrown: ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "INFO 17:25:40.434 (FedoraLdp) HEAD for: resources/ext/imagingserver/Non_Object/Non-Object Archive/GlassNegProject/GlassNegDocumentation/.DS_Store",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "INFO 17:25:40.473 (WildcardExceptionMapper) Exception intercepted by WildcardExceptionMapper:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "java.lang.IllegalArgumentException: Illegal character in path at index 90: ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://dams01-test.artic.edu/fcrepo/rest/resources/ext/imagingserver/Non_Object/Non-Object"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://dams01-test.artic.edu/fcrepo/rest/resources/ext/imagingserver/Non_Object/Non-Object",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " Archive/GlassN",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "egProject/GlassNegDocumentation/.DS_Store/fcr:metadata",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at java.net.URI.create(URI.java:859) ~[na:1.7.0_55]",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at org.glassfish.jersey.uri.UriTemplate.normalize(UriTemplate.java:399) ~[jersey-common-2.13.jar:na]",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at org.glassfish.jersey.message.internal.JerseyLink$Builder.resolveLinkUri(JerseyLink.java:174) ~[jersey-common-2.13.jar:na]",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at org.glassfish.jersey.message.internal.JerseyLink$Builder.build(JerseyLink.java:161) ~[jersey-common-2.13.jar:na]",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at org.glassfish.jersey.message.internal.JerseyLink$Builder.build(JerseyLink.java:73) ~[jersey-common-2.13.jar:na]",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at org.fcrepo.http.api.FedoraLdp.addResourceLinkHeaders(FedoraLdp.java:521) ~[fcrepo-http-api-4.0.0-beta-05-SNAPSHOT.jar:na]",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at org.fcrepo.http.api.FedoraLdp.addResourceLinkHeaders(FedoraLdp.java:506) ~[fcrepo-http-api-4.0.0-beta-05-SNAPSHOT.jar:na]",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at org.fcrepo.http.api.FedoraLdp.addOptionsHttpHeaders(FedoraLdp.java:500) ~[fcrepo-http-api-4.0.0-beta-05-SNAPSHOT.jar:na]",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at org.fcrepo.http.api.FedoraLdp.addResourceHttpHeaders(FedoraLdp.java:470) ~[fcrepo-http-api-4.0.0-beta-05-SNAPSHOT.jar:na]",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at org.fcrepo.http.api.FedoraLdp.head(FedoraLdp.java:148) ~[fcrepo-http-api-4.0.0-beta-05-SNAPSHOT.jar:na]",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at sun.reflect.GeneratedMethodAccessor69.invoke(Unknown Source) ~[na:na]",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "I can access other .DS_Store files but this one (and one in sibling directories) has a space in its path. I can access other files under the path containing the space, but not .DS_Store files. ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Will try some more combination to establish a pattern. ",
